#, no-wrap
msgid "The animation below shows the **nutation**: a resonant drive rotates the Bloch vector steadily about the $x$-axis, carrying it from $|0\\rangle$ down toward $|1\\rangle$ and back. This is the very motion the Rabi curve measures.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng animation sa ibaba ang **nutation**: tuluy-tuloy na iniikot ng resonant na drive ang Bloch vector sa paligid ng $x$-axis, dinadala ito mula $|0\\rangle$ pababa papunta sa $|1\\rangle$ at pabalik. Ito mismo ang galaw na sinusukat ng Rabi curve.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
